# pd/pdk/technology.example — committed TEMPLATE showing a per-technology drop-in
# layout. Only this file + README.md are tracked; anything else you place here is
# ignored so an experiment never leaks NDA content. Copy this to
# pd/pdk/<technology>/ (via `cva6-build tech init <technology>`) for a real drop.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
